    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but resting isnt the same as finding a way out. what if there isnt a way out? i look down and the drop just looks so quiet. so still. compared to all this noise and the struggle of trying to find a path that isn't there anymore, the silence down there looks... peaceful. like it's the only place where i don't have to keep trying to see through the fog.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
